[orch:err] ### milvus-io/milvus#51845 — feat: Add optimistic CAS for partial updates
[orch:err] - State: `OPEN` · Closing-link from PR: no · Source: `cross`
[orch:err] - URL: https://github.com/milvus-io/milvus/pull/51845
[orch:err] - Author: weiliu1031
